WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.700 --> 00:00:05.100
Oh, Hello!

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:06.600
Welcome

00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:08.800
to the Sense8 lab.

00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:15.760
I'm glad that the universe conspired to realing

00:00:15.900 --> 00:00:17.900
what was off-center.

00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:19.700
The minute the desicion was made,

00:00:19.900 --> 00:00:21.300
everything has been super-speedy,

00:00:21.700 --> 00:00:23.500
incredibly high octane.

00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:25.300
Everything had to go, go, go!

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:29.900
We're back!

00:00:32.600 --> 00:00:34.500
You were funnier last season.

00:00:36.900 --> 00:00:37.800
Our show

00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:39.300
builds bridges,

00:00:39.300 --> 00:00:40.500
empowers people.

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:42.300
We all bleed when we're cut.

00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:43.500
We all have the same thoughts.

00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:45.500
We all feel grief and love.

00:00:45.500 --> 00:00:47.000
It's always been about that common humanity.

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:49.000
It's a show that is for everyone.

00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:51.900
We are surrounded

00:00:51.900 --> 00:00:54.100
by the best quality of human beings

00:00:54.200 --> 00:00:55.800
that we could have.

00:00:55.800 --> 00:00:57.500
It's been beautiful.

00:00:57.500 --> 00:00:58.600
Every pizzeria joint,

00:00:58.600 --> 00:00:59.900
every set location,

00:00:59.900 --> 00:01:01.900
they were there by the dozens.

00:01:01.900 --> 00:01:03.000
It was nuts!

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:04.800
I've never seen anything like that.

00:01:04.800 --> 00:01:05.900
It's because of the show.

00:01:05.900 --> 00:01:07.400
Brazil, ıt was really crazy,

00:01:07.400 --> 00:01:09.000
but really passionate.

00:01:09.500 --> 00:01:11.300
We also get to be a part of that.

00:01:11.300 --> 00:01:12.900
To see them, listen to these stories,

00:01:12.900 --> 00:01:14.600
and possibly use that energy

00:01:14.700 --> 00:01:15.900
while filming.

00:01:15.900 --> 00:01:17.100
All those people,

00:01:17.100 --> 00:01:17.900
in every country,

00:01:17.900 --> 00:01:20.100
they are our extended cluster.

00:01:20.400 --> 00:01:22.900
It just feels like a big ball of love.

00:01:24.200 --> 00:01:26.500
My goodness, what a journey.

00:01:26.500 --> 00:01:28.500
I'm proud to be a part of this,

00:01:28.500 --> 00:01:30.100
and happy that we can

00:01:30.100 --> 00:01:31.400
give them an end

00:01:31.400 --> 00:01:32.600
that will satisfy them.

